# Froggy Fu's gather region, decoded from libil2cpp.so 2026-08-21.
# ``UnifiedFroggyFuAttractionPlanner`` is the concrete
# ``IFroggyFuAttractionPlanner``, and its two small distance helpers are the
# whole of the region test:
#
#     CalcBoardDistance(a, b, chebyshev) = chebyshev ? max(|dx|,|dy|) : |dx|+|dy|
#     InGatherRegion(p, lotus, r, cheb)  = CalcBoardDistance(p, lotus, cheb) <= r
#
# so the lotus only ever touches pieces inside a square (Square shape) or a
# diamond (Diamond shape) of `gatherRadius` around itself -- never the whole
# board. `FroggyFu.GatherShape` is Square = 0, Diamond = 1, and Square is the
# one that uses the Chebyshev (max) distance.
