# That settles the red flip-flop. The 2026-08-21 runs (11-24-10_204,
# 11-23-40_527, solo) saw red wiped; the 2026-08-28 05:07:40 measurement saw a
# red three leave the other reds standing. On 2026-09-15 06:30:33 (solo) the
